00:12:40.636 --> 00:12:43.161
we can see the
chain that it chooses is none.

253
00:12:43.983 --> 00:12:45.763
This means that it
will be passed to

254
00:12:45.763 --> 00:12:47.544
the default chain which
itself is just a

255
00:12:47.544 --> 00:12:49.770
